    <div class="card-off"><div class="card-t">Generative Models: Diffusion and Flows</div><div class="card-d">준비 중입니다.</div></div>
    <div class="card-off"><div class="card-t">Generalization</div><div class="card-d">준비 중입니다.</div></div>
